xplicit user confirmation: ask and wait, or choose a safer method. Avoid data exfiltration: post to chat platforms or tickets only when the user directed it, and never share secrets unless the user authorized that secret and its destination.\\n</system-reminder>"},{"role":"user","content":"<system-reminder>\\n<workspace_instructions trust=\\"untrusted\\" authority=\\"guidance_only\\">Use the project formatter.</workspace_instructions>\\n\\nWorkspace: /workspace\\n\\nCurrent date (UTC): 2026-11-13\\n\\nPermission mode: default. Sandbox read-only: read files only; network restricted.\\nNo approver: approval requests are denied. Do not bypass restrictions.\\n</system-reminder>"},{"role":"user","content":"Fix the failing test."},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"exec-1","type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_command","arguments":"{\\"cmd\\":\\"npm test\\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"AGENC_DATA\\n1 test failed\\n\\n\\n[exit 1 wall_time=1.2500s tokens=4]\\nAGENC_DATA","tool_call_id":"exec-1"}],"max_tokens":32000,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"tool2__system_x2esearchTools","description":"Find unlisted tools by name or keyword (tools, not files or code). Listed tools are ready. select loads a tool's schema by exact name.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"},"select":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_command","description":"Inspect/test/build; edit via edit tools, rm/mv for delete/rename. Call tools, never print placeholders. Long jobs: background=true; leftovers stop on return. Linux sandbox: run servers and clients in one command; background jobs have private loopback. Lasting services need detach. Other fields (tty, login, shell, detach, additional_permissions) are accepted; system.searchTools select:exec_command loads their schema.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"cmd":{"type":"string"},"workdir":{"type":"string","description":"Default: workspace root."},"timeoutMs":{"type":"number","description":"Max wait, ms; then runs on as a session."},"background":{"type":"boolean"},"yield_time_ms":{"type":"number","description":"Wait ms; live processes return session_id. Default 30000 (tty 10000)."},"max_output_tokens":{"type":"number","description":"Token cap; head/tail truncation."},"sandbox_permissions":{"type":"string","enum":["default","require_escalated","with_additional_permissions"],"description":"Escalation mode; scoped requests use additional_permissions."},"justification":{"type":"string","description":"Why elevated execution is needed."},"prefix_rule":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Command prefix for approval caching."}},"required":["cmd"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write_stdin","description":"Continue exec_command's session_id; kill_process stops it. Empty chars polls; input requires initial tty=true. Include command newlines.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"session_id":{"type":"number","description":"exec_command session_id."},"chars":{"type":"string","description":"Input; empty polls."},"yield_time_ms":{"type":"number","description":"Wait ms."},"max_output_tokens":{"type":"number","description":"Output token cap."},"sandbox_permissions":{"type":"string","enum":["default","require_escalated","with_additional_permissions"],"description":"Input needs the session's own value; polls need none."},"justification":{"type":"string","description":"Why elevated execution is needed."}},"required":["session_id"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"kill_process","description":"Stop sessions exec_command started in this conversation: session_id for one, session_ids for several, all=true for every one still running. Never stop processes by searching the process table for file names or command text: that also matches AgenC's own processes.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"session_id":{"type":"number"},"session_ids":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"number"}},"all":{"type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"FileRead","description":"Read text/images/PDFs/notebooks; authorizes edits. Prefer 1-based offset/limit line windows: default 2000 lines, cap 25000 tokens. Line numbers are sparse and display-only. Successful edits need no reread. PDF pages and dense line numbers: system.searchTools select:FileRead.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"number"},"limit":{"type":"number"}},"required":["file_path"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"Write","description":"Create/replace files; existing files require FileRead first. Use apply_patch for partial changes.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string"},"content":{"type":"string"}},"required":["file_path","content"],"additionalProperties":false}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"apply_patch","description":"Patch:\\n*** Begin Patch\\n...hunks...\\n*** End Patch\\n*** Add File: path (+lines); *** Update File: path (@@ chunks, optional *** Move to: path); *** Delete File: path.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"input":{"type":"string"}},"required":["input"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"thinking":{"type":"enabled"}}"`;

